<h1>It's approved, you've got <%= @namespace.name %>!</h1>

<p>You can view your new gem.coop namespace <%= link_to @namespace.name, @namespace %> here.</p>

<p>To start pushing your gems, generate a <%= link_to "new push key", new_user_push_key_url %>.</p>

